+### Assign a ticket: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`
+
+```json
+{ "assignee": "dana" }
+```
+
+Assigns the ticket to that agent. `{"assignee": null}` unassigns it. An agent is a non-empty name of at most 64
+characters. Answers 200 with the ticket.
+
+Only open and in-progress tickets can be assigned or unassigned (409 `conflict` otherwise). Assigning a ticket to the
+agent it already has changes nothing: no audit entry, and `updated` stays. The agent a ticket is assigned to is notified.
